# Python

Python 3.11, fully typed, must pass mypy --strict and ruff.

Pydantic v2 models for every boundary (HTTP, TinyFish, DB). Frozen models where possible.

Async all the way. No blocking I/O in async paths.

No bare except. Raise typed domain errors from sentinel.core.errors. Never swallow exceptions.

structlog with bound context (case_id, run_id). Never log API keys, request headers, or full page bodies.

Only the sentinel.tinyfish package may talk to TinyFish.
